      "id": "D5",
      "summary": "primitive.mode was never read, so every topology was decoded into a flat index list that all three loaders divided by three and drew as a triangle list: a TRIANGLE_STRIP lost every triangle after the first, a point cloud became one arbitrary triangle, and neither warned. GLTF-071 reads and classifies the mode; GLTF-072 converts a strip or fan to a triangle list with winding preserved; GLTF-073/GLTF-076/GLTF-078 give the four topologies that describe no triangles a real draw path -- a PrimitiveType on ModelMeshPart, a \u00a712.3 primitive count, and a LINE_LOOP's implicit closing segment.",
